  "description": "A 3,900-year-old god became human overnight, losing her divine powers, her dao, and her humanity. It was the king of Joseon, Yi Hul, who had stolen her peaches and fled.\n\nWith nowhere to go, Horang offers to let her stay in his palace,\n\nBelieving that she will end his long drought, he grants her the favor...\n\n**Original Novel:**  \n[Naver Novel](https://novel.naver.com/webnovel/list?novelId=830078), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/novel/detail.series?productNo=4559104)\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Naver Webtoon](https://comic.naver.com/webtoon/list?titleId=814544), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=10062156)",
